settings-selector-layout-card = Layout
settings-selector-display-mode-label = Display mode
settings-selector-display-mode-desc = Choose how wallpaper cards are arranged in the picker.
settings-selector-filter-motion-label = Filter motion
settings-selector-filter-motion-desc = How quickly the roll runs when filter results change. The three shared weights live in Motion settings.
settings-selector-presets-card = Presets
settings-selector-preset-generated-name = Style { $number }
settings-selector-saved-styles-label = Saved styles
settings-selector-live-preview-card = Colour preview
settings-selector-live-preview-label = Preview themes on hover
settings-selector-live-preview-desc = Recolour the picker from the wallpaper under the pointer. The current theme returns when the pointer leaves, unless you apply.
settings-selector-type-badges-label = Show type badges
settings-selector-type-badges-desc = Mark wallpaper cards as Pic, Vid, or WE so the file type is visible without opening the card.
settings-selector-composition-card = Composition
settings-selector-composition-card-desc-hex = Choose the overall field shape, then adjust its bend, tile shape, rows, and columns.
settings-selector-composition-card-desc-wall = Choose a wall layout, then adjust its density, spacing, and cards.
settings-selector-hex-curve-label = Geometric mode
settings-selector-hex-curve-desc = Choose whether the whole field stays flat or bends into an arc, wave, S shape, or cylinder.
settings-selector-hex-curve-flat = Plane
settings-selector-hex-curve-arc = Bow
settings-selector-hex-curve-wave = Ribbon
settings-selector-hex-curve-s = S sweep
settings-selector-hex-curve-cylinder = Cylinder
settings-selector-hex-shape-label = Tile family
settings-selector-hex-shape-desc = Choose a tessellating tile. Diamond and Rhombus wrap one wallpaper in vertical or horizontal geometry.
settings-selector-hex-shape-triangle = Triangle
settings-selector-hex-shape-hexagon = Hexagon
settings-selector-hex-shape-diamond = Diamond
settings-selector-hex-shape-rhombus = Rhombus
settings-selector-hex-intensity-label = Bend strength
settings-selector-hex-intensity-desc = Move right to make the selected field shape bend more strongly.
settings-selector-hex-waves-label = Waves
settings-selector-hex-waves-desc = How many ribbon waves cross the field.
settings-selector-hex-orbit-radius-label = Cylinder radius
settings-selector-hex-orbit-radius-desc = Smaller values wrap the field more tightly.
settings-selector-hex-rows-label = Rows
settings-selector-hex-cols-label = Columns
settings-selector-cells-card = Cells
settings-selector-cells-card-desc = Change tile size and spacing without changing the selected field shape.
settings-selector-hex-cell-size-label = Cell size
settings-selector-hex-gap-x-label = Horizontal spacing
settings-selector-hex-gap-y-label = Vertical spacing
settings-selector-wall-mode-label = Wall mode
settings-selector-wall-mode-desc = Choose how Wall arranges cards. Each mode uses different row sizing and scrolling behaviour.
settings-selector-wall-mode-uniform = Uniform
settings-selector-wall-mode-brick = Brick
settings-selector-wall-mode-masonry = Masonry
settings-selector-wall-mode-justified = Justified
settings-selector-wall-mode-editorial = Editorial
settings-selector-wall-mode-cylinder = Cylinder
settings-selector-grid-columns-label = Columns
settings-selector-grid-rows-label = Rows
settings-selector-grid-stagger-label = Balance
settings-selector-grid-stagger-desc = Change alternating row offset, or the lead-card size in Editorial mode.
settings-selector-grid-bend-label = Curvature
settings-selector-grid-bend-desc = Positive wraps away; negative bows toward you.
settings-selector-grid-cylinder-radius-label = Cylinder radius
settings-selector-grid-cylinder-radius-desc = Smaller values make the wrap tighter.
settings-selector-cards-card = Cards
settings-selector-cards-card-desc = Adjust card size, spacing, and corner shape.
settings-selector-card-width-label = Card width
settings-selector-card-height-label = Card height
settings-selector-grid-gap-x-label = Horizontal spacing
settings-selector-grid-gap-x-desc = Visible edge-to-edge space between columns.
settings-selector-grid-gap-y-label = Vertical spacing
settings-selector-grid-gap-y-desc = Visible edge-to-edge space between rows.
settings-selector-performance-card = Performance
settings-selector-performance-card-desc = Every grain is separate geometry. Larger grains mean fewer shapes and much less GPU work.
settings-selector-sand-note-discrete = This load is small for the detected discrete GPU. The same grain size can be about 150 times slower on an integrated GPU.
settings-selector-sand-note-integrated = Sand may be GPU-bound on this integrated GPU. Increase grain size or keep automatic motion detail enabled.
settings-selector-sand-meter-label = { $count } grains/frame  ·  { $load }
settings-selector-sand-meter-desc = Grain { $grain } at a typical centre image · { $card } ({ $tier }) · { $note }
settings-selector-sand-load-very-heavy = Very heavy
settings-selector-sand-load-heavy = Heavy
settings-selector-sand-load-moderate = Moderate
settings-selector-sand-load-light = Light
settings-selector-grain-size-label = Grain size
settings-selector-grain-size-desc = Grain size in pixels. 1 means one grain per image pixel and is the heaviest; larger grains look chunkier but cost much less.
settings-selector-render-scale-label = Render scale
settings-selector-render-scale-desc = Render sand at a lower resolution and upscale. Saves less than grain size, because grains are geometry rather than pixels.
settings-selector-lod-auto-label = Auto motion detail
settings-selector-lod-auto-desc = Increase grain size while scrolling fast. On by default on integrated GPUs, where it cuts motion cost about 3.5x.
settings-selector-lod-strength-label = Motion detail strength
settings-selector-lod-strength-desc = Max grain multiplier at full scroll speed when motion detail runs.
settings-selector-sandy-card = Sandy
settings-selector-sandy-card-desc = The current wallpaper sits centred above a row of round thumbnails. Picking another breaks both images into grains that leave and enter through opposite edges.
settings-selector-sandy-center-label = Centre height
settings-selector-sandy-slice-height-label = Slice height
settings-selector-sandy-slice-width-label = Slice width
settings-selector-sandy-gap-label = Gap
settings-selector-sandy-gap-desc = Gap between skewed slices at their vertical midpoint. 0 makes edges touch; negative values overlap.
settings-selector-sandy-skew-label = Skew
settings-selector-sandy-edge-speed-label = Edge scroll
settings-selector-sandy-edge-speed-desc = Carousel pan speed at the screen edges, 100 = default.
settings-selector-sand-card = Sand
settings-selector-sand-card-desc = How the grains travel. All percentages, 100 = default.
settings-selector-sandy-duration-label = Duration
settings-selector-sandy-duration-desc = Total time from the old image starting to leave until the new image finishes assembling.
settings-selector-sandy-blend-label = Blend
settings-selector-sandy-blend-desc = Colour sweep length; ring fades run at half this.
settings-selector-sandy-strands-label = Ribbons
settings-selector-sandy-strands-desc = Split the grains into more or fewer visible streams.
settings-selector-sandy-twist-label = Twist
settings-selector-sandy-twist-desc = Corkscrew intensity along each ribbon.
settings-selector-sandy-orbit-label = Orbit
settings-selector-sandy-orbit-desc = How wide grains spiral around their ribbon.
settings-selector-sandy-turbulence-label = Turbulence
settings-selector-sandy-turbulence-desc = Random twisting of the ribbon paths.
settings-selector-sandy-waist-label = Waist
settings-selector-sandy-waist-desc = Mid-flight pinch of the streams; lower = tighter throat.
settings-selector-sandy-front-label = Front
settings-selector-sandy-front-desc = Stagger when different parts of the old image leave. Higher values keep later regions in place longer.
settings-selector-sandy-fan-label = Fan
settings-selector-sandy-fan-desc = Stream spread at the edges, or swirl in vortex mode.
settings-selector-swap-style-label = Swap style
settings-selector-swap-style-desc = Choose the path grains follow between the old and new images.
settings-selector-sandy-arc-label = Arc
settings-selector-sandy-arc-desc = Loop size when the corner-loop swap is enabled.
settings-selector-swap-loop-label = Corner loop swap
settings-selector-swap-loop-desc = Interrupting picks loop grains through the top corner instead of lifting into the spinning ring.
settings-selector-outgoing-live-label = Outgoing video stays live
settings-selector-outgoing-live-desc = Keep the old video playing while it turns to sand. Video-to-video changes run a second decoder until the transition ends; off carries a frozen frame at no extra cost.
settings-selector-ring-card = Ring
settings-selector-ring-card-desc = These settings control the spinning grain ring shown while you move quickly through wallpapers. A value of 100 is the default.
settings-selector-ring-size-label = Size
settings-selector-ring-size-desc = Orbit diameter relative to the hero. The ring still follows the hero's aspect ratio; 100 preserves the designed size.
settings-selector-ring-spin-label = Spin
settings-selector-ring-spin-desc = Orbit speed of the band.
settings-selector-ring-wave-label = Wave
settings-selector-ring-wave-desc = Radial waviness rippling through the band.
settings-selector-ring-soft-label = Softness
settings-selector-ring-soft-desc = Higher values use larger, fainter grains and make the ring less sharply defined.
settings-selector-ring-blend-label = Ring blend
settings-selector-ring-blend-desc = Colour sweep length while ringed.
settings-selector-ring-hold-label = Settle delay
settings-selector-ring-hold-desc = How long after the last pick before the ring commits to the hero.
settings-selector-slice-size-card = Slice size
settings-selector-slice-height-label = Slice height
settings-selector-visible-count-label = Visible items
settings-selector-expanded-width-label = Selected width
settings-selector-slice-width-label = Slice width
settings-selector-slice-gap-label = Gap
settings-selector-slice-gap-desc = Gap between skewed slices at their vertical midpoint. 0 makes edges touch; negative values overlap.
settings-selector-skew-label = Skew
settings-selector-edge-tilt-label = Edge tilt
settings-selector-edge-tilt-desc = Slant the top and bottom edges. Positive values raise the right edge; negative values raise the left edge.
settings-selector-wobble-label = Wobble
settings-selector-wobble-desc = Cards bend in the scroll direction and spring back when scrolling stops. Faster movement also separates the colour channels.
settings-selector-wobble-strength-label = Wobble strength
settings-selector-wobble-strength-desc = A value of 100 is the default. A value of 200 doubles the bend and colour separation.
settings-selector-corners-card = Corners
settings-selector-card-flip-card = Card flip
settings-selector-card-flip-card-desc = Choose how a wallpaper card changes from its thumbnail to the details on its back.
settings-selector-flip-effect-label = Effect
settings-selector-flip-effect-desc = The thumbnail shader used during the first phase.
settings-selector-flip-shader-label = Thumbnail shader
settings-selector-flip-shader-desc = Turn off to skip the thumbnail effect and reveal the back directly.
settings-selector-flip-back-label = Back reveal
settings-selector-flip-back-desc = Turn off to snap the back panel in after the thumbnail effect finishes.
settings-selector-flip-duration-label = Duration override
settings-selector-flip-duration-desc = Total card-flip time. This intentionally overrides the shared UI motion weights.
settings-selector-tag-cloud-card = Search
settings-selector-tag-cloud-card-desc = The tag and description search panel that drops below the picker.
settings-selector-tag-cloud-width-label = Width
settings-selector-tag-cloud-width-desc = Width of the search panel.
settings-selector-tag-cloud-rows-label = Clickable tag rows
settings-selector-tag-cloud-rows-desc = How many rows of clickable suggestions open below the search field.
settings-selector-tag-cloud-rows-one = 1 row
settings-selector-tag-cloud-rows-two = 2 rows
settings-selector-tag-cloud-rows-three = 3 rows
settings-selector-video-preview-card = Video preview
settings-selector-video-preview-card-desc = A moving preview when you hover or select a video.
settings-selector-video-preview-label = Enable video preview
settings-selector-video-preview-desc = Animate the video itself on hover/selection instead of a static thumbnail.
settings-selector-preview-delay-label = Preview delay
settings-selector-preview-delay-desc = Wait this long on hover/selection before the preview starts (ms).
settings-selector-tag-cloud-position-card = Search panel position
settings-selector-tag-cloud-position-card-desc = Place the search panel on screen. Screen position overrides pixel offsets while enabled.
settings-selector-tag-position-enabled-label = Use screen position
settings-selector-tag-position-enabled-desc = Keep the search panel at these screen coordinates when its size or picker style changes. Turn off to use pixel offsets.
settings-selector-tag-position-x-label = Left edge
settings-selector-tag-position-x-desc = Set the search panel's left edge as a percentage of screen width.
settings-selector-tag-position-y-label = Top edge
settings-selector-tag-position-y-desc = Set the search panel's top edge as a percentage of screen height.
settings-selector-tag-offset-x-label = Search panel horizontal offset
settings-selector-tag-offset-x-desc = Used when screen position is off. Move the panel left or right relative to this picker.
settings-selector-tag-offset-y-label = Search panel vertical offset
settings-selector-tag-offset-y-desc = Used when screen position is off. Move the panel up or down relative to this picker.
settings-selector-mode-slices = Slices
settings-selector-mode-hex = Geometric
settings-selector-mode-wall = Wall
settings-selector-mode-sandy = Sandy
settings-selector-gpu-tier-discrete = Discrete
settings-selector-gpu-tier-integrated = Integrated
settings-selector-gpu-tier-other = Other
settings-selector-swap-style-vortex = Vortex
settings-selector-swap-style-hourglass = Hourglass
settings-selector-swap-style-castle = Sandcastle
settings-selector-swap-style-saltation = Saltation
settings-selector-swap-style-pour = Glass pour
settings-selector-swap-style-orbit = Maelstrom
settings-selector-swap-style-burst = Burst
settings-selector-swap-style-weave = Weave
settings-selector-swap-style-bloom = Bloom
settings-selector-swap-style-flock = Murmuration
settings-selector-swap-style-ring = Ring

settings-selector-mode-hand = Card hand
settings-selector-hand-card = Card hand
settings-selector-hand-card-desc = A fan of tall cards held like a hand of playing cards in perspective. Move the pointer to tilt the hand, drag the stage to spin it, and scroll past the edge to deal the next hand.
settings-selector-hand-move-label = Deal move
settings-selector-hand-move-desc = How cards fly out and the next hand flies in. Cycle walks the enabled moves in order; Random picks one of them each deal. Switch moves off below to leave them out.
settings-selector-hand-move-random = Random
settings-selector-hand-move-cycle = Cycle
settings-selector-hand-move-corkscrew = Corkscrew
settings-selector-hand-move-cascade = Cascade
settings-selector-hand-move-shuffle = Shuffle
settings-selector-hand-move-ribbon = Ribbon
settings-selector-hand-move-spiral = Spiral
settings-selector-hand-count-label = Cards in hand
settings-selector-hand-count-desc = Cards shown at once, 3 to 9.
settings-selector-hand-card-width-label = Card width
settings-selector-hand-card-height-label = Card height
settings-selector-hand-spread-label = Fan spread
settings-selector-hand-spread-desc = Horizontal distance between neighbouring cards. Sizes are design pixels on a 1440 x 900 stage and scale with the screen.
settings-selector-hand-perspective-label = Perspective
settings-selector-hand-perspective-desc = Camera distance. Lower values exaggerate depth.
settings-selector-hand-tilt-label = Pointer tilt
settings-selector-hand-tilt-desc = How far the whole hand leans toward the pointer. 0 disables the tilt.
settings-selector-hand-speed-label = Speed
settings-selector-hand-speed-desc = Deal and flip speed, 100 = default.
settings-selector-ribbons-card = Ribbons
settings-selector-ribbons-card-desc = Each card is cut into ribbons that swing open one by one when a card flips, and fly apart in the ribbon deal.
settings-selector-hand-ribbon-axis-label = Cut direction
settings-selector-hand-ribbon-axis-rows = Rows
settings-selector-hand-ribbon-axis-columns = Columns
settings-selector-hand-ribbons-label = Ribbons
settings-selector-hand-ribbons-desc = Number of ribbons per card, 2 to 14.
settings-selector-hand-cut-label = Cut angle
settings-selector-hand-cut-straight = Straight
settings-selector-hand-cut-slant = Slant
settings-selector-hand-cut-steep = Steep
settings-selector-hand-cut-variance-label = Cut variance
settings-selector-hand-cut-variance-desc = Randomise ribbon widths and angles per card.
settings-selector-hand-cut-variance-none = Even
settings-selector-hand-cut-variance-soft = Soft
settings-selector-hand-cut-variance-wild = Wild
settings-selector-hand-effects-card = Atmosphere
settings-selector-hand-effects-card-desc = Optional layers around the hand.
settings-selector-hand-ghosts-label = Ghost trails
settings-selector-hand-ghosts-desc = Blurred, brightened copies trail each card while dealing.
settings-selector-hand-backdrop-label = Blurred backdrop
settings-selector-hand-backdrop-desc = Fill the screen with a dark, blurred copy of the selected wallpaper behind the hand.
settings-selector-hand-bob-label = Idle bob
settings-selector-hand-bob-desc = Cards drift gently while the picker is open. This keeps the picker animating, so it costs GPU time while idle.
settings-selector-hand-fan-angle-label = Fan angle
settings-selector-hand-fan-angle-desc = Yaw added per card away from the centre. 0 keeps every card facing you.
settings-selector-hand-fan-roll-label = Fan roll
settings-selector-hand-fan-roll-desc = Tilt added per card, like cards splayed in a hand. 0 keeps them upright.
settings-selector-hand-arch-label = Arch
settings-selector-hand-arch-desc = How far outer cards drop below the centre card.
settings-selector-hand-skew-label = Skew
settings-selector-hand-skew-desc = Shear the card outline into a parallelogram, in pixels of horizontal offset.
settings-selector-hand-backdrop-blur-label = Backdrop blur
settings-selector-hand-backdrop-blur-desc = Blur radius of the backdrop, 100 = default.
settings-selector-hand-reveal-fill-label = Preview fills the frame
settings-selector-hand-reveal-fill-desc = When the hand flips to the preview, the cards stretch to tile a full-size picture. Off keeps every card at its own width and height and scales the row to fit.

settings-selector-start-position-label = Start position
settings-selector-start-position-desc = Open at the beginning, at the last wallpaper you applied, or where you stopped browsing. Uses the current filters.
settings-selector-start-position-beginning = Beginning
settings-selector-start-position-applied = Last applied wallpaper
settings-selector-start-position-browsing = Last browsing position
settings-selector-loop-around-label = Loop at the ends
settings-selector-loop-around-desc = Moving past the first or last wallpaper jumps to the other end. Held keys, paging and fast scrolling stop at the end first, so press or scroll again to loop. Online sources loop once every page has loaded. In the Wall layout and in online sources the mouse wheel only scrolls the view.

settings-selector-mode-depth = Depth
settings-selector-depth-card = Depth cards
settings-selector-depth-desc = Cards shrink toward the edges. As you scroll, artwork shifts inside each card according to its position in the row.

settings-selector-parallax-label = Image parallax
settings-selector-parallax-desc = Shift artwork inside each card as it moves across the view. The image keeps moving through the visible edges.
settings-selector-mode-collection = Collection
settings-selector-collection-desc = Browse a tilted stack with the wheel or arrow keys. Click a card to expand it; click again or press Escape to return. Press Enter to apply. Right-click for details.

settings-selector-depth-height-label = Card height
settings-selector-depth-height-desc = Height of the centre card. Large cards shrink to fit the screen.

settings-selector-depth-width-label = Card width
settings-selector-depth-width-desc = Width of the centre card in pixels.

settings-selector-depth-spacing-label = Card spacing
settings-selector-depth-spacing-desc = Distance between card centres in pixels before depth falloff.

settings-selector-depth-count-label = Visible cards
settings-selector-depth-count-desc = Maximum number of cards around the current selection.

settings-selector-depth-falloff-label = Depth falloff
settings-selector-depth-falloff-desc = Scale reduction per card away from the centre, from 0 to 1. Zero keeps their sizes equal.


settings-selector-depth-skew-label = Card skew
settings-selector-depth-skew-desc = Slant the card edges. Zero keeps them upright.

settings-selector-depth-speed-label = Navigation duration
settings-selector-depth-speed-desc = Time for a navigation movement in milliseconds. Lower values move faster.

settings-selector-collection-size-label = Card size
settings-selector-collection-size-desc = Card width as a percentage of screen height.

settings-selector-collection-spacing-label = Stack spacing
settings-selector-collection-spacing-desc = Vertical distance between stacked cards as a percentage of card size.

settings-selector-collection-count-label = Visible cards
settings-selector-collection-count-desc = Maximum number of cards in the stack.

settings-selector-collection-tilt-label = Stack tilt
settings-selector-collection-tilt-desc = Tilt the stack away from you. Zero shows the cards face-on.


settings-selector-collection-speed-label = Motion speed
settings-selector-collection-speed-desc = Speed of navigation and opening or closing a card. Higher values move faster.

settings-selector-depth-frame-label = Selection frame
settings-selector-depth-frame-desc = Draw a highlighted border around the selected card.

settings-selector-shadows-label = Card shadows
settings-selector-shadows-desc = Draw a shadow behind each card.
